  55:Middlewares/ST/filex/common/src/fx_directory_rename.c **** /*    changed to the new name.  Otherwise, if the directory is not found, */
  56:Middlewares/ST/filex/common/src/fx_directory_rename.c **** /*    the appropriate error code is returned to the caller.               */
